<title>USA: CNA says acquires Caronia.</title>
<headline>CNA says acquires Caronia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNA Financial Corp said it acquired 100 percent of the stock of Managed Care Holdings Corp and its wholly-owned unit, Caronia Corp.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Caronia, based in Palm Beach Gardens, Fla., is an independently owned claims and risk management firm. It will operate as a business unit of CNA HealthPro, a risk management service provider and underwriter for the health care industry.</p>
<p>CNA is a major U.S. insurance group.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
